{"text":"Snow is falling, but it isn't white. It's grey. And by a small fire, under the roots of a huge black tree, there's a boy in a beanie. He's thinner. His arms are wrapped in dark strips of cloth. He doesn't look up. He talks to the fire, the way he used to talk to her through his bedroom door. \"Mom. I'm alive. I wrote you something.\" She calls out. \"Where are you?\" He looks up.","mood":"sad","settings":{"stability":0.4,"style":0.7,"speed":1.02},"alignment":{"characters":["S","n","o","w"," ","i","s"," ","f","a","l","l","i","n","g",","," ","b","u","t"," ","i","t"," ","i","s","n","'","t"," ","w","h","i","t","e","."," ","I","t","'","s"," ","g","r","e","y","."," ","A","n","d"," ","b","y"," ","a"," ","s","m","a","l","l"," ","f","i","r","e",","," ","u","n","d","e","r"," ","t","h","e"," ","r","o","o","t","s"," ","o","f"," ","a"," ","h","u","g","e"," ","b","l","a","c","k"," ","t","r","e","e",","," ","t","h","e","r","e","'","s"," ","a"," ","b","o","y"," ","i","n"," ","a"," ","b","e","a","n","i","e","."," ","H","e","'","s"," ","t","h","i","n","n","e","r","."," ","H","i","s"," ","a","r","m","s"," ","a","r","e"," ","w","r","a","p","p","e","d"," ","i","n"," ","d","a","r","k"," ","s","t","r","i","p","s"," ","o","f"," ","c","l","o","t","h","."," ","H","e"," ","d","o","e","s","n","'","t"," ","l","o","o","k"," ","u","p","."," ","H","e"," ","t","a","l","k","s"," ","t","o"," ","t","h","e"," ","f","i","r","e",","," ","t","h","e"," ","w","a","y"," ","h","e"," ","u","s","e","d"," ","t","o"," ","t","a","l","k"," ","t","o"," ","h","e","r"," ","t","h","r","o","u","g","h"," ","h","i","s"," ","b","e","d","r","o","o","m"," ","d","o","o","r","."," ","\"","M","o","m","."," ","I","'","m"," ","a","l","i","v","e","."," ","I"," ","w","r","o","t","e"," ","y","o","u"," ","s","o","m","e","t","h","i","n","g",".","\""," ","S","h","e"," ","c","a","l","l","s"," ","o","u","t","."," ","\"","W","h","e","r","e"," ","a","r","e"," ","y","o","u","?","\""," ","H","e"," ","l","o","o","k","s"," ","u","p","